                    <value>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(221, 20, 20); font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Important: Seismic EOL effective January 31, 2025&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Intel’s contract with Seismic &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(24, 24, 24);&quot;&gt;ended&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt; January 31, 2025. Please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://goto.intel.com/SMR&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales and Marketing Resources (SMR)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt; to access your content needs.&amp;nbsp;For questions about SMR, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://salescrmtraining.intel.com/sales-tools/smr/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;the SMR Training page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Please bookmark these resource links: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Symbol; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://goto.intel.com/SMR&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;goto/SMR&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Symbol; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://goto.intel.com/CCGresources&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;goto/CCGresources&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Symbol; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://goto.intel.com/DCAIResources&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;goto/DCAIresources&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Symbol; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://goto.intel.com/AIresources&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;goto/AIresources&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</value>
